  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of <math alttext=\"x squared plus x plus y squared plus y equals StartFraction 199 Over 2 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>199</mn>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane is a circle. What is the length of the circle&rsquo;s radius?</p>",
